# Solutions

## Fiber Network Solutions by Market

Clearfield offers end-to-end solutions for rapid fiber deployment across a variety of market segments. Our FieldSmart® product line is engineered to simplify installation and reduce truck rolls.

### Broadband Service Providers (BSPs)
Scalable fiber management solutions for ISPs deploying FTTH/FTTP networks. Products designed for rapid deployment in both greenfield and brownfield environments.

### Municipalities & Co-ops
Turnkey fiber solutions for municipal broadband and rural electric cooperative networks. Simplified deployment and long-term scalability.

### MDU & Commercial
Fiber management solutions optimized for multi-dwelling units, commercial buildings and campus environments.

### Government & Defense
Rugged fiber solutions for government, military and utility applications.

## Rapid Deployment Architecture
Pre-connectorized solutions designed to reduce installation time by up to 40% versus traditional spliced networks.

## FieldSmart Design Assistance
Clearfield offers FieldSmart Design Assistance — a technical resource program where Clearfield's engineering team works with customers (ISPs, co-ops) to help plan and design fiber networks using Clearfield products. This includes product placement guidance, bill-of-materials development, and informal network layout recommendations.

## Network Design Tools
Clearfield offers access to network planning tools and resources integrated with its FieldSmart product line. This may include CAD drawings of products and CAD symbol libraries for use in third-party design software.

