# Markets We Serve

## Broadband Service Providers (BSPs)

Clearfield serves ISPs, telcos, and cable MSOs deploying FTTH and FTTP networks. Our FieldSmart products simplify outside plant infrastructure and enable rapid, scalable fiber deployment for providers of all sizes.

## Rural Electric Cooperatives

We serve rural electric cooperatives entering the broadband market through programs like BEAD and ReConnect. Our products are designed for rural OSP environments and support rapid greenfield deployment.

## Municipalities and Government

Municipal broadband operators and government network builders rely on Clearfield products for reliable, scalable fiber infrastructure.

## Competitive Landscape

Key competitors include Corning, CommScope, OFS (Furukawa), AFL, and PPC Broadband in the fiber equipment/connectivity segment.

## BEAD Opportunity

Clearfield is positioned to benefit significantly from BEAD deployment acceleration in 2025-2026 as ISPs and co-ops begin purchasing equipment for funded network builds.

